ECM-owned follow-up to the retained vendor CVE-2026-116741 correction.
Independent review found negative truncation and signed-overflow bypasses.
Preserve the existing pre-flush truncation policy; make bounds arithmetic safe.
No ABI change. Native and allocation-failure sanitizer regressions are required.

